  "details": "I logged into VRC on 12/2 running build 1263 and noticed I was getting 10fps in VR. Messing around a bit, I found out that cloth components now cause a ton more fps drop than before. I have a lot of cloth on all of my models so I don't expect amazing fps, but I would always aim for 50fps. After the update, I am stuck at 10fps even in desktop mode (whereas I would get over 50fps before with the same model).\n\nNo real steps to reproduce this but I do have plenty of models with this issue now.",
